<title>HONG KONG: Morgan issues warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>Morgan issues warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Thursday it has issued 94 million warrants on shares of Hutchsion Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$64.00    PREMIUM	 15.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.005    GEARING	 6.4X</p>
<p> MATURITY	  23.JAN.98   MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$64.00    LISTING	 HONG KONG</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT DATE 24.FEB.97   LISTING DATE  27.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS</p>
<p>		     AT THE DISCRETION OF THE ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
